  "term": "design fluency test",
  "definition": "The design fluency test is a cognitive task from the Delis-Kaplan Executive Function System that is used to assess higher-level thinking, particularly metacognition. In the source, it is one of the measures used to compare cognitive functioning in youth soccer players.",
